==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
Literally “for what”, from {{term|za||for|lang=sh}} + {{m|sh|štȍ||what}}. For the conjunction compare {{term|zato što|lang=sh}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/zâʃto/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|za|što|lang=sh}}

===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=zȁšto|r|зашто|за̏што}}

# [[why]], [[what for]]
#: ''zašto (da) ne?'' — why not?
#: ''zašto to?'' — why so? why is that?

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|why}} {{l|sh|štȍ}}

===Conjunction===
{{sh-conjunction|head=zȁšto|r|зашто|за̏што}}

# {{context|archaic|lang=sh}} [[because]]

====Synonyms====
* (''Croatia'') {{l|sh|zakaj}}, {{l|sh|zač}}
* {{l|sh|zàtō}}

